  "raw_text": "f the Chick-fil-A Spicy Deluxe was unavailable, what would you order instead, including the chain and the specific item? User: Probably the chicken strips Agent: And why do you consider the chicken strips to be the closest replacement for your favorite Spicy Deluxe? User: . I just don't really like the other sandwiches so I prefer to get strips if I was unable to get that. Agent: I understand. Now, could you name two or three similar items you also like from any chain? For each one, please tell me what's better or worse compared to your favorite Chick-fil-A Spicy Deluxe. User: The quarter pounder with cheese, it's a little bit more filling but not as good. The McChicken which is a little bit more affordable but not as good either. Agent: Thank you for sharing those comparisons. What do you usually pair with your Chick-fil-A Spicy Deluxe, such as drinks, sides, or sauces? And what would you never pair it with, and why? User: Sprite and Chick-fil-A sauce. Agent: Okay, Sprite and Chick-fi",
